htmx.org 1.9.12
Source: https://unpkg.com/htmx.org@1.9.12/dist/htmx.min.js
Vendored (not CDN-loaded) so the login/renew/payment pages never depend on a
third-party script at runtime. To upgrade: download the new
dist/htmx.min.js from https://unpkg.com/htmx.org@<version>/dist/htmx.min.js,
overwrite static/htmx.min.js, and update this file.
